		{"id":"app-entry","type":"text","x":-1050,"y":-1100,"width":460,"height":230,"text":"### Point d'entrée\n`TesseraApp` → `RootView` (lancement, onglets, feuilles, `onOpenURL`)\n- [TesseraApp.swift](../../App/TesseraApp.swift)"},
		{"id":"tabs","type":"text","x":-550,"y":-1100,"width":460,"height":230,"text":"### Onglets\nAccueil · Créer · Store · Mes widgets\n[[Accueil-Mon-Quotidien]] · [[Creer-espaces]] · [[Store]] · [[Mes-widgets]]"},
		{"id":"screens","type":"text","x":-50,"y":-1100,"width":460,"height":230,"text":"### Écrans\nMini-apps, Studio, Profil, Premium, tutoriel\n[[Mini-apps]] · [[Studio-editeur]] · [[Profil-et-reglages]] · [[Premium-et-abonnements]]"},
		{"id":"components","type":"text","x":450,"y":-1100,"width":460,"height":230,"text":"### Composants\nAperçus de widgets à taille réelle, sélecteur de style\n- [UIComponents.swift](../../App/Components/UIComponents.swift)\n- [StylePicker.swift](../../App/Components/StylePicker.swift)"},
		{"id":"appmodel","type":"text","x":-1050,"y":-680,"width":460,"height":260,"text":"### AppModel\n@Observable, @MainActor : source unique, écrit tout, recharge les widgets, caches réseau\n[[Noyau-AppModel]]\n- [AppModel.swift](../../App/Core/AppModel.swift)"},
		{"id":"router","type":"text","x":-550,"y":-680,"width":460,"height":260,"text":"### Router\nOnglet, feuilles, Studio, paywall, liens `tessera://`\n- [Router.swift](../../App/Core/Router.swift)\n- [DeepLink.swift](../../Shared/Support/DeepLink.swift)"},
		{"id":"premiumstore","type":"text","x":-50,"y":-680,"width":460,"height":260,"text":"### PremiumStore\nStoreKit 2, droits en cache pour l'extension\n[[Premium-et-abonnements]]\n- [PremiumStore.swift](../../App/Premium/PremiumStore.swift)"},
		{"id":"daily","type":"text","x":450,"y":-680,"width":460,"height":260,"text":"### Mon Quotidien et analyses\nBrief du jour, agenda, analyses écrites depuis les données\n- [DailyBrief.swift](../../App/Core/DailyBrief.swift)\n- [Insights.swift](../../Shared/Data/Insights.swift)"},
		{"id":"domains","type":"text","x":-1050,"y":-240,"width":460,"height":270,"text":"### Domaines\n11 états métier + profil\n[[Domaines-metier]]\n- [Nutrition.swift](../../Shared/Domains/Nutrition.swift)\n- [Fitness.swift](../../Shared/Domains/Fitness.swift)\n- [Budget.swift](../../Shared/Domains/Budget.swift)"},
		{"id":"models","type":"text","x":-550,"y":-240,"width":460,"height":270,"text":"### Modèle de widget\n`WidgetDesign`, `WidgetKind` (103), styles (57), palettes, packs, modèles\n- [WidgetDesign.swift](../../Shared/Model/WidgetDesign.swift)\n- [WidgetKind.swift](../../Shared/Model/WidgetKind.swift)\n- [WidgetStyle.swift](../../Shared/Model/WidgetStyle.swift)"},
		{"id":"render","type":"text","x":-50,"y":-240,"width":460,"height":270,"text":"### Rendu partagé\n`WidgetCanvas`, tuiles, écran verrouillé, thèmes\n[[Widgets-extension]]\n- [WidgetCanvas.swift](../../Shared/Render/WidgetCanvas.swift)\n- [Theme.swift](../../Shared/Theme/Theme.swift)"},
		{"id":"support","type":"text","x":450,"y":-240,"width":460,"height":270,"text":"### Support\nFormats, dates, couleurs, `tr()`, rappels\n[[Localisation]]\n- [Localization.swift](../../Shared/Support/Localization.swift)\n- [SmartReminders.swift](../../Shared/Support/SmartReminders.swift)"},
		{"id":"sharedstore","type":"text","x":-1050,"y":220,"width":460,"height":270,"text":"### SharedStore\nJSON par domaine dans l'App Group `group.com.dakrsnyk.tessera`, dossier `Tessera/`\n[[Donnees-et-stockage]]\n- [SharedStore.swift](../../Shared/Support/SharedStore.swift)"},
		{"id":"payload","type":"text","x":-550,"y":220,"width":460,"height":270,"text":"### Données des widgets\n`PayloadLoader`, `DataNeeds`, `DomainData`, `SampleData`\n- [PayloadLoader.swift](../../Shared/Data/PayloadLoader.swift)\n- [DomainData.swift](../../Shared/Data/DomainData.swift)"},
		{"id":"backup","type":"text","x":-50,"y":220,"width":460,"height":270,"text":"### Sauvegarde\nUn fichier qui contient tout ; import des sauvegardes Tessera\n- [DataBackup.swift](../../App/Core/DataBackup.swift)"},
		{"id":"resources","type":"text","x":450,"y":220,"width":460,"height":270,"text":"### Ressources\nCNF, démos d'exercices, StoreKit, entitlements\n- [cnf-foods.json](../../App/Resources/cnf-foods.json)\n- [ExerciseDemos.json](../../App/Resources/ExerciseDemos.json)\n- [Tessera.storekit](../../Config/Tessera.storekit)\n- [Tessera.entitlements](../../Config/Tessera.entitlements)"},
		{"id":"bundle","type":"text","x":1150,"y":-680,"width":460,"height":230,"text":"### TesseraWidgetsBundle\nLes widgets de l'extension (groupes par domaine, horloge, calendrier, tâches…) et l'activité en direct\n- [TesseraWidgetsBundle.swift](../../Widgets/TesseraWidgetsBundle.swift)\n- [DesignWidgets.swift](../../Widgets/DesignWidgets.swift)"},
		{"id":"provider","type":"text","x":1150,"y":-410,"width":460,"height":230,"text":"### DesignProvider\nUn fournisseur pour tous les types ; lit le SharedStore, rafraîchit météo, crypto, taux\n- [DesignProvider.swift](../../Widgets/DesignProvider.swift)"},
		{"id":"intents","type":"text","x":1150,"y":-140,"width":460,"height":230,"text":"### App Intents\nBoutons des widgets, activité en direct, configuration\n[[Intents-et-activite-en-direct]]\n- [SpaceIntents.swift](../../Shared/Intents/SpaceIntents.swift)\n- [InteractiveIntents.swift](../../Shared/Intents/InteractiveIntents.swift)"},
		{"id":"live","type":"text","x":1150,"y":130,"width":460,"height":230,"text":"### Activité en direct\nActivityKit : séance sur l'écran verrouillé et la Dynamic Island\n- [WorkoutLiveActivity.swift](../../Shared/Live/WorkoutLiveActivity.swift)\n- [WorkoutLiveActivityWidget.swift](../../Widgets/WorkoutLiveActivityWidget.swift)"},
